      "heading": "Mengorganisir dengan Groups",
      "id": "tutorial-groups",
      "intro": "Groups membantu Anda mengelompokkan node-node yang terkait. Ini membuat flow lebih rapi, mudah dibaca, dan mudah dikelola. Bayangkan group sebagai \"folder\" untuk node-node Anda.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuat Group",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Cara 1:** Pilih node (Shift+Klik) \u2192 Klik kanan \u2192 **Group**\n\u2022 **Cara 2:** Klik kanan canvas \u2192 **Add Group** \u2192 Seret node ke dalamnya\n\u2022 Group bisa diberi nama sesuai fungsinya",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fbcfe8;overflow:hidden;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"border:1.5px dashed #ec4899;border-radius:6px;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#db2777;margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M22 19a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 012 2z\"/></svg> Cek Amount</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#f59e0b;\">CONSTANT > 50JT</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#10b981;\">CONTAINS FOREIGN</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Mengelola Group",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 \u270f\ufe0f **Edit nama** \u2014 Klik dua kali judul group\n\u2022 \ud83c\udfa8 **Ubah warna** \u2014 Pilih warna dari palet\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcd0 **Ubah ukuran** \u2014 Seret pojok kanan bawah\n\u2022 \ud83c\udf00 **Collapse/Expand** \u2014 Klik segitiga untuk menutup/membuka\n\u2022 \u27a1\ufe0f **Pindah** \u2014 Seret judul group untuk memindahkan semua isinya",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#92400e;\">\u270f\ufe0f Edit nama</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fdf2f8;border:1px solid #fbcfe8;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#9d174d;\">\ud83c\udfa8 Warna</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;\">\ud83d\udcd0 Ukuran</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">\ud83c\udf00 Collapse</span></div>"
